    <worksheet name='Marketing Recommendations'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='20'>&lt;Sheet Name&gt;</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>(Select only one segment)</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='final_customer_segments' name='federated.1r4e03l0i4ldk21dtds6k1t6sjt0' />
          </datasources>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.1r4e03l0i4ldk21dtds6k1t6sjt0'>
            <column caption='Segment Recommendation' datatype='string' name='[Calculation_1563816009928704]' role='measure' type='nominal'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE ATTR([segment_name])&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;WHEN &quot;High-Value Lapsed Customers&quot; THEN&#13;&#10;&quot;Objective: Reactivate high-value customers and increase purchase frequency.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Strategy: VIP Win-Back Campaign&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Actions:&#13;&#10;• Grant VIP status and communicate their value to the company.&#13;&#10;• Offer personalized discounts based on previous purchases.&#13;&#10;• Enroll customers in a loyalty program with points and expedited shipping.&#13;&#10;• Run an A/B test comparing the promotional offer against an incentivized feedback survey.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Primary KPIs: Reactivation Rate, Repeat Purchase Rate, Customer Lifetime Value.&quot;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;WHEN &quot;Loyal Repeat Customers&quot; THEN&#13;&#10;&quot;Objective: Retain loyal customers and increase customer lifetime value.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Strategy: Loyalty &amp; Value Growth&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Actions:&#13;&#10;• Strengthen the loyalty program with points and exclusive rewards.&#13;&#10;• Use personalized cross-selling based on previous purchases.&#13;&#10;• Offer incentives for reaching spending or order milestones.&#13;&#10;• Provide early access to selected products or promotions.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Primary KPIs: Retention Rate, Purchase Frequency, AOV, Customer Lifetime Value.&quot;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;WHEN &quot;Recent Mid-Value Customers&quot; THEN&#13;&#10;&quot;Objective: Encourage a second purchase and develop long-term loyalty.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Strategy: Second-Purchase Conversion&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Actions:&#13;&#10;• Send personalized follow-up campaigns after the first purchase.&#13;&#10;• Recommend complementary products based on the initial order.&#13;&#10;• Provide a limited-time incentive for the next purchase.&#13;&#10;• Test different follow-up messages and offers.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Primary KPIs: Second-Purchase Rate, Conversion Rate, Repeat Purchase Rate.&quot;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;WHEN &quot;Recent Low_Value Customers&quot; THEN&#13;&#10;&quot;Objective: Increase customer spending and encourage another purchase.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Strategy: Basket Growth&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Actions:&#13;&#10;• Recommend related low-cost products.&#13;&#10;• Create product bundles to increase basket size.&#13;&#10;• Offer minimum-spend incentives.&#13;&#10;• Use personalized follow-up messages based on previous purchases.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Primary KPIs: Average Order Value, Second-Purchase Rate, Revenue per Customer.&quot;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;WHEN &quot;Inactive Low_Value Customers&quot; THEN&#13;&#10;&quot;Objective: Reactivate inactive customers while controlling acquisition costs.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Strategy: Automated Win-Back Campaign&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Actions:&#13;&#10;• Send low-cost automated reactivation emails.&#13;&#10;• Offer a targeted limited-time incentive.&#13;&#10;• Recommend products related to previous purchases.&#13;&#10;• Reduce marketing investment for customers who remain inactive after repeated campaigns.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Primary KPIs: Reactivation Rate, Conversion Rate, Campaign ROI.&quot;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;END' />
            </column>
            <column-instance column='[segment_name]' derivation='None' name='[none:segment_name:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
            <column caption='Segment Name' datatype='string' name='[segment_name]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
              <aliases>
                <alias key='&quot;Inactive Low_Value Customers&quot;' value='Inactive Low Value Customers' />
                <alias key='&quot;Recent Low_Value Customers&quot;' value='Recent Low Value Customers' />
                <alias key='&quot;Recent Mid-Value Customers&quot;' value='Recent Mid Value Customers' />
              </aliases>
            </column>
            <column-instance column='[Calculation_1563816009928704]' derivation='User' name='[usr:Calculation_1563816009928704:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
          </datasource-dependencies>
          <slices>
            <column>[federated.1r4e03l0i4ldk21dtds6k1t6sjt0].[none:segment_name:nk]</column>
          </slices>
          <aggregation value='true' />
        </view>
        <style />
        <panes>
          <pane selection-relaxation-option='selection-relaxation-allow'>
            <view>
              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class='Automatic' />
